OL,3,GNEWSATwo cleared of drive-by gang
OL,4,Ashooting of teen girl
OL,5,
OL,6,FA rapper and his friend have been
OL,7,Fcleared of murdering a 17-year-old girl
OL,8,Fin a drive-by gang shooting in north
OL,9,FLondon after four trials at the Old
OL,10,FBailey.
OL,12,FTanesha Melbourne-Blake was fatally
OL,13,Fshot in the street as she danced and
OL,14,Fsocialised with friends in Tottenham on
OL,15,Fthe evening of Easter Monday on 2 April
OL,16,F2018.
