OL,4,Ashooting of teen girl
OL,5,
OL,6,FRapper Marcus La Croix, 38, from
OL,7,FHackney, was cleared of her murder and
OL,8,Fpossession of a firearm with intent to
OL,9,Fendanger life following a retrial
OL,10,Fearlier this year, it can now be
OL,11,Freported.
OL,13,FMelbourne-Blake's family have sat
OL,14,Fthrough a total of four Old Bailey
OL,15,Ftrials ` two each for Clarke and La
OL,16,FCroix, also known as Bobby Slater.
